        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👑 Be Evil. Be Lazy. Rule the World.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the <strong>Laziest Evil Lord in history</strong> — too tired to swing a sword or yell at your minions. But that won’t stop you from taking over the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back and relax while your loyal (and slightly clueless) minions march out <i>on their own</i> to destroy human castles and conquer <strong>1,000 areas</strong>. Upgrade them, empower them with ancient treasures, and watch your empire grow — all without leaving the throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦴 <strong>Auto-Send Minions</strong><br>They march out whether you care or not. No micro, no stress — just pure idle evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💸 <strong>Upgrade With Gold</strong><br>Collect gold from every conquest and spend it to upgrade minion strength, intelligence (barely), and unlock new chaotic unit types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 <strong>Discover Lord Treasures</strong><br>Ancient artifacts grant passive boosts: stronger attacks, faster spawns, scale up time... so you can conquer while napping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏰 <strong>1,000 Areas to Crush</strong><br>From tiny villages to massive human fortresses — destroy them all and claim the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛌 <strong>Be Rewarded for Doing Nothing</strong><br>Idle progression means your army keeps fighting even when you’re away. Evil never sleeps — but you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💬 <strong>A Word from Your Minions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;My lord is so lazy, it's inspiring.&quot;<br>— Goblin #43, currently on fire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I conquered a castle while he was watching cat videos. Legendary.&quot;<br>— Skeleton #12</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you've ever dreamed of conquering the world without standing up — <strong>Lazy Lord</strong> is your destiny.<br>Sit back. Relax.<br>Let your minions do the dirty work.<br><strong>The world shall kneel.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👑 Be Evil. Be Lazy. Rule the World.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the <strong>Laziest Evil Lord in history</strong> — too tired to swing a sword or yell at your minions. But that won’t stop you from taking over the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back and relax while your loyal (and slightly clueless) minions march out <i>on their own</i> to destroy human castles and conquer <strong>1,000 areas</strong>. Upgrade them, empower them with ancient treasures, and watch your empire grow — all without leaving the throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦴 <strong>Auto-Send Minions</strong><br>They march out whether you care or not. No micro, no stress — just pure idle evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💸 <strong>Upgrade With Gold</strong><br>Collect gold from every conquest and spend it to upgrade minion strength, intelligence (barely), and unlock new chaotic unit types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 <strong>Discover Lord Treasures</strong><br>Ancient artifacts grant passive boosts: stronger attacks, faster spawns, scale up time... so you can conquer while napping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏰 <strong>1,000 Areas to Crush</strong><br>From tiny villages to massive human fortresses — destroy them all and claim the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛌 <strong>Be Rewarded for Doing Nothing</strong><br>Idle progression means your army keeps fighting even when you’re away. Evil never sleeps — but you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💬 <strong>A Word from Your Minions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;My lord is so lazy, it's inspiring.&quot;<br>— Goblin #43, currently on fire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I conquered a castle while he was watching cat videos. Legendary.&quot;<br>— Skeleton #12</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you've ever dreamed of conquering the world without standing up — <strong>Lazy Lord</strong> is your destiny.<br>Sit back. Relax.<br>Let your minions do the dirty work.<br><strong>The world shall kneel.</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "You're the Laziest Evil Lord ever—too lazy to fight, yet destined to rule the world. Send minions (automatically), upgrade them with gold and treasures, and conquer 1,000 areas without leaving the throne. Evil has never been this effortless.",
